      "message": "perf(sim): skip the sideways march for a rapid at or above the stock top\n\nsurface_before is capped at the stock top and the tip lift is never\nnegative, so such a rapid can never be convicted by the march; the\ncommon retract-height link no longer samples ~19.5k points (PR #160\nreview). A NaN height still marches (fails closed).\n\nRefs #140\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
